<title>UK: Banco Boavista ups and prices September 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Boavista ups and prices September 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier by lead manager ABN Amro Hoare has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO BOAVISTA</p>
<p> AMT  *$100 MLN	 COUPON     10.0	MATURITY    20.SEP.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.95     PAY DATE  S-20.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75	REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD     +369 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/BRAZIL/BAHAMAS</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.375 pct june 2000 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
<p> NOTES    *LAUNCHED EARLIER FOR $75 MLN.</p>
<p>	     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON.</p>
<p>London Newsroom  +44 171 542 7970</p>
